ning, Testing and Prediction. A persons image will be captured in different light intensities and pose. These images are stored in the database. This is training. When the person faces the camera, his/her images will be verified with that of the trained images in the database. This is testing. The final step is the prediction, which tells us if it is a success ( when there is a match between the image captured and the images in the database) or a failure ( when there is no match between the image captured and the images in the database).","topics":[],"score":284823,"global_rank":31034,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":6581},{"name":"noname01/couplet-generator","owner":"noname01","html_url":"https://github.com/noname01/couplet-generator","stars":5,"forks":3,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"Chinese couplet generator using Tensorflow Seq2Seq","topics":[],"score":284821,"global_rank":31036,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":6582},{"name":"lewisgoing/fl-studio-mcp","owner":"lewisgoing","html_url":"https://github.com/lewisgoing/fl-studio-mcp","stars":4,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":[],"score":284819,"global_rank":31037,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":6583},{"name":"prb/uphill-speed","owner":"prb","html_url":"https://github.com/prb/uphill-speed","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"Compute per-segment rate of gain/loss from GPX tracks.","topics":[],"score":284815,"global_rank":31040,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":6584},{"name":"alexWhitworth/zettlr_rag","owner":"alexWhitworth","html_url":"https://github.com/alexWhitworth/zettlr_rag","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"MD-RAG / LLM-Knowledge wiki for paper + book notes","topics":[],"score":284815,"global_rank":31041,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":6585},{"name":"newmanix/django-template","owner